msgstr "High school/university graduates from various countries"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:698
msgid "海聯會或各地台灣辦事處"
msgstr "ALATS or various Taiwan offices"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:705
msgid "學費與生活費參考"
msgstr "Tuition fees and living expenses reference"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:708
msgid "以下費用資料為概略參考，實際金額依各校、各系所及入學年度公告為準。請務必向目標學校確認最新收費標準。"
msgstr ""
"The following fee information is a rough reference. The actual amount is "
"subject to the announcements of each school, department and admission year. "
"Be sure to check with your target school for the latest fee schedule."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:713
msgid "費用項目"
msgstr "Expense items"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:714
msgid "金額（新臺幣）"
msgstr "Amount (NTD)"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:715
msgid "備註"
msgstr "Remark"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:721
msgid "學士班學雜費（文法商）"
msgstr "Tuition and fees for bachelor's degree (Grammar and Business)"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:722
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:730
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:738
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:746
