#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "香港、澳門學生依據《香港澳門關係條例》來台就學，入台方式及居留申請程序與一般外籍生不同。本頁整理港澳生常見的入台文件、居留證申請流程及注意事項。"
msgstr ""
"Hong Kong and Macau students studying in Taiwan are governed by the Act "
"Governing Relations with Hong Kong and Macao. Their entry procedures and "
"residence permit applications differ from those of regular international "
"students. This page covers common entry documents, ARC application "
"procedures, and important notes for HK/Macau students."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "依港澳關係條例辦理"
msgstr "Governed by HK/Macau Relations Act"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "抵台 15 天內辦居留"
msgstr "Apply for residence within 15 days of arrival"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "移民署：0800-024-111"
msgstr "NIA: 0800-024-111"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "港澳生受到特別保障："
msgstr "Special protections for HK/Macau students:"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "香港及澳門居民依《香港澳門關係條例》在台就學，享有許多類似本國生的優惠待遇（如宿舍優先、獎學金資格等），但居留申請程序仍須透過移民署辦理。"
msgstr ""
"Hong Kong and Macau residents studying in Taiwan under the Act Governing "
"Relations with Hong Kong and Macao enjoy many benefits similar to "
"domestic students (such as dormitory priority and scholarship "
"eligibility), but must still apply for residence permits through the "
"National Immigration Agency."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "持港澳身份入台"
msgstr "Enter Taiwan with HK/Macau identity"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "使用臺灣入出境許可證"
msgstr "Using Taiwan Entry/Exit Permit"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "持香港永久居民身份證（或澳門居民身份證）向內政部移民署或駐外館處申請"
msgstr ""
"Apply with your Hong Kong Permanent Resident Identity Card (or Macau "
"Resident Identity Card) through the National Immigration Agency or an "
"overseas representative office"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "臺灣地區入出境許可證"
msgstr "Taiwan Area Entry/Exit Permit"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "，再以此入台就讀。"
msgstr ", then use it to enter Taiwan for study."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "入台後需申請港澳居民居留許可（居留證）。"
msgstr ""
"After arriving in Taiwan, you must apply for a Hong Kong/Macau Resident "
"Residence Permit (ARC)."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "持外國護照入台"
msgstr "Enter Taiwan with a foreign passport"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "使用外國護照 + 居留簽"
msgstr "Using foreign passport + resident visa"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "同時持有他國護照（如英國 BN(O)、葡萄牙等）的港澳生，可選擇以外國護照申請"
msgstr ""
"HK/Macau students who also hold a foreign passport (e.g., British BN(O), "
"Portuguese, etc.) may choose to apply with their foreign passport for a"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "學生居留簽（Resident Visa）"
msgstr "Student Resident Visa"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "入台。"
msgstr "to enter Taiwan."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "此類情況辦理流程接近一般外籍生，抵台後申請外僑居留證（ARC）。"
msgstr ""
"In this case, the process is similar to regular international students — "
"apply for an Alien Resident Certificate (ARC) after arrival."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "不確定自己應走哪一條路線，建議在出發前聯絡"
msgstr "If you are unsure which route applies to you, contact"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "或直接致電移民署（0800-024-111），說明持有的旅行證件類型，即可獲得最準確的指引。"
msgstr ""
"or call the NIA directly at 0800-024-111 and describe the type of travel "
"document you hold to receive the most accurate guidance."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "15 天"
msgstr "15 days"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "抵台後起算"
msgstr "from date of arrival"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "起"
msgstr "starting from"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "1年$1,000 / 2年$2,000 / 3年$3,000"
msgstr "1 yr: NT$1,000 / 2 yrs: NT$2,000 / 3 yrs: NT$3,000"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "依就學期間"
msgstr "Based on study period"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "通常每年換證"
msgstr "Renewed annually"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "10 個工作天"
msgstr "10 working days"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "不含退補件；預約可加快"
msgstr "Excluding returned cases; appointment may speed up processing"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "以港澳身份入台者，需提供入出境許可證正本及影本。"
msgstr ""
"Those entering with HK/Macau identity must provide the original and a "
"copy of the Entry/Exit Permit."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "持港澳證件者必備"
msgstr "Required for HK/Macau document holders"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "香港 / 澳門永久居民身份證"
msgstr "Hong Kong / Macau Permanent Resident Identity Card"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "港澳居民身份證正本及影本，作為身份認定之用。"
msgstr ""
"Original and copy of HK/Macau Resident Identity Card for identity "
"verification."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "必要"
msgstr "Required"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "在學證明書"
msgstr "Certificate of Enrollment"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "由台灣就讀學校出具，載明科系、就學期間。學校 OIA 可協助申請。"
msgstr ""
"Issued by your Taiwan school, stating your department and enrollment "
"period. The school's OIA can assist with the application."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "照片 2 張"
msgstr "2 passport photos"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "近 6 個月內 2 吋白底彩色照片（寬 3.5 cm × 高 4.5 cm）。"
msgstr ""
"Color photos taken within the past 6 months, 2 inches, white background "
"(3.5 cm wide × 4.5 cm tall)."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "居留申請書"
msgstr "Residence Application Form"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "移民署官網下載或現場索取，請事先填妥。"
msgstr "Download from the NIA website or obtain on-site. Fill out in advance."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "健康檢查合格證明"
msgstr "Health Examination Certificate"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "初次申請通常需附，須至指定醫院檢查。辦理前請向移民署或學校確認。"
msgstr ""
"Usually required for first-time applications. Must be done at a "
"designated hospital. Confirm with the NIA or school before proceeding."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "初次申請通常需要"
msgstr "Usually required for first-time applications"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "住宿地址證明"
msgstr "Proof of Accommodation Address"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "宿舍住宿證或租屋合約書，部分辦事處要求提供。"
msgstr ""
"Dormitory residency certificate or rental contract. Required by some "
"offices."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "視情況"
msgstr "As required"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "外國護照（持外國護照者）"
msgstr "Foreign Passport (for those entering with a foreign passport)"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "以外國護照入台者，需備護照正本及影本，並附上入台居留簽證。"
msgstr ""
"Those entering with a foreign passport must provide the original and a "
"copy of the passport, along with the Taiwan resident visa."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "持外國護照者適用"
msgstr "Applicable to foreign passport holders"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "抵台後前往學校國際事務處（OIA）報到"
msgstr ""
"Report to the school's Office of International Affairs (OIA) after "
"arrival"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "OIA 通常在迎新時統一說明居留申請流程，並提供在學證明書及文件確認服務。抵台當天或次日即應前往，確認文件清單。"
msgstr ""
"The OIA typically explains the residence application process during "
"orientation and provides certificate of enrollment and document "
"verification services. Visit on the day of arrival or the next day to "
"confirm your document checklist."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "抵台當天或次日"
msgstr "Day of arrival or next day"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "OIA 通常有團體辦理場次"
msgstr "OIA usually holds group application sessions"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "取得在學證明書"
msgstr "Obtain Certificate of Enrollment"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "向 OIA 申請學校出具的在學證明書。若迎新時已發放，可直接進入下一步。部分學校在報到後即可當日取件。"
msgstr ""
"Request the certificate of enrollment from the OIA. If it was already "
"distributed during orientation, proceed to the next step. Some schools "
"issue it on the same day as registration."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "抵台後 1～2 天"
msgstr "1–2 days after arrival"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "健康檢查（初次申請者）"
msgstr "Health Examination (first-time applicants)"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "初次申請居留需至移民署指定合格醫院進行健康檢查，取得健康檢查合格證明書。學校 OIA 通常會提供指定醫院清單，可事先線上預約。"
msgstr ""
"First-time applicants must undergo a health examination at an "
"NIA-designated hospital and obtain a health certificate. The school OIA "
"usually provides a list of designated hospitals; online appointment "
"booking is recommended."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "抵台後 2～5 天"
msgstr "2–5 days after arrival"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "建議事先網路預約，節省等待時間"
msgstr "Book online in advance to save waiting time"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "整理文件並預約移民署"
msgstr "Prepare documents and schedule an NIA appointment"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "將所有文件整理妥當並備好正本及影本，至移民署官網線上預約辦理時段。建議選擇就近的移民署辦事處（桃園市即桃園服務站）。"
msgstr ""
"Organize all documents with originals and copies ready, then book a time "
"slot online via the NIA website. Choose the nearest NIA office (Taoyuan "
"Service Station for Taoyuan City)."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "抵台後 3～7 天"
msgstr "3–7 days after arrival"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "建議線上預約"
msgstr "Online appointment recommended"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "前往移民署辦事處提交申請"
msgstr "Visit the NIA office to submit your application"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "攜帶所有文件至移民署，現場核對文件、採集指紋並繳費。可由 OIA 統一帶隊辦理（若有安排），或自行前往。"
msgstr ""
"Bring all documents to the NIA office for document verification, "
"fingerprinting, and payment. The OIA may arrange a group visit (if "
"scheduled), or you may go independently."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "抵台 15 天內"
msgstr "Within 15 days of arrival"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "移民署辦事處"
msgstr "NIA Service Center"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "等待審核（約 10 個工作天）"
msgstr "Wait for processing (approx. 10 working days)"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "申請後約"
msgstr "Approximately"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "製卡完成（不含退補件），移民署以簡訊通知領件。等待期間持入境許可證（或護照）及申請收據可作為合法居留暫時證明。"
msgstr ""
"The card will be ready (excluding returned cases). The NIA will notify "
"you by SMS when it is ready for collection. During the waiting period, "
"your Entry/Exit Permit (or passport) and application receipt serve as "
"temporary proof of legal residence."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "約 10 個工作天"
msgstr "Approx. 10 working days"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "領取居留證"
msgstr "Collect your residence permit"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "持入境許可證（或護照）及收據親赴辦事處領取居留證。領取後可辦理加入健保、申辦手機門號及銀行開戶。"
msgstr ""
"Bring your Entry/Exit Permit (or passport) and receipt to the NIA office "
"to collect your residence permit. Afterwards, you may enroll in National "
"Health Insurance, apply for a phone plan, and open a bank account."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "完成！"
msgstr "Done!"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "港澳生的居留證跟一般外籍生的 ARC 一樣嗎？"
msgstr ""
"Is the HK/Macau student residence permit the same as the ARC for regular "
"international students?"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "功能上相同，但法源不同。"
msgstr "Functionally the same, but based on different laws."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "一般外籍生辦理「"
msgstr "Regular international students apply for the \""

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "外僑居留證（ARC）"
msgstr "Alien Resident Certificate (ARC)"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "」，依據《入出國及移民法》。"
msgstr "\", governed by the Immigration Act."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "以港澳身份入台的港澳生辦理「"
msgstr "HK/Macau students entering with HK/Macau identity apply for the \""

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "港澳居民居留證"
msgstr "Hong Kong/Macau Resident Residence Permit"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "」，依據《香港澳門關係條例》。"
msgstr "\", governed by the Act Governing Relations with Hong Kong and Macao."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "兩者在台均可用於身份核驗、健保加保及銀行開戶等日常事務。"
msgstr ""
"Both documents can be used in Taiwan for identity verification, NHI "
"enrollment, and opening a bank account."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "在台期間可以打工嗎？"
msgstr "Can I work part-time while studying in Taiwan?"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid ""
"港澳生持居留證可申請工讀許可（每週不超過 20 "
"小時）。需向學校取得工讀同意書後，至勞動部辦理工作許可。在校內工讀（如圖書館、系辦助理）通常只需學校同意，手續較簡便。未取得合法工作許可的工作行為依法屬違規，請務必事先申請。"
msgstr ""
"HK/Macau students with a residence permit may apply for a part-time work "
"permit (no more than 20 hours per week). You must first obtain a "
"part-time work consent letter from your school, then apply for a work "
"permit from the Ministry of Labor. On-campus jobs (e.g., library "
"assistant, department office) typically only require school approval and "
"involve simpler procedures. Working without a legal work permit is a "
"violation of law — always apply in advance."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "居留證到期後怎麼辦？"
msgstr "What should I do when my residence permit expires?"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "居留證通常每年更新一次，到期前"
msgstr "The residence permit is typically renewed annually. Within"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "30 天內"
msgstr "30 days"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "即可申請延期。延期所需文件與初次申請類似（在學證明書、居留證正本、照片等），無需再繳健康檢查費。延期規費 NT$500。建議提早辦理以避免逾期。"
msgstr ""
"before expiry, you may apply for an extension. Required documents are "
"similar to the initial application (certificate of enrollment, original "
"residence permit, photos, etc.) — no health examination fee is required "
"for renewal. The renewal fee is NT$500. Apply early to avoid "
"overstaying."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "港澳生可以加入全民健保嗎？"
msgstr "Can HK/Macau students enroll in National Health Insurance (NHI)?"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid ""
"可以。取得居留證後，透過學校衛生保健組辦理加保即可。保費依年度費率由學校代扣，學生費率比一般標準低。加保後就醫診所門診費用約 "
"NT$150，享有與台灣學生相同的健保保障。"
msgstr ""
"Yes. After receiving your residence permit, enroll through the school "
"health center. Premiums are deducted by the school at the annual rate, "
"and the student rate is lower than the standard rate. After enrollment, "
"clinic consultation fees are approximately NT$150, providing the same "
"NHI coverage as Taiwanese students."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "暑假返港澳超過 2 個月，健保怎麼處理？"
msgstr ""
"If I return to HK/Macau for more than 2 months during summer break, what "
"happens to my NHI?"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "離台超過 2 個月前，可至學校衛保組辦理「"
msgstr ""
"Before leaving Taiwan for more than 2 months, you may apply through the "
"school health center for \""

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "出國停保"
msgstr "overseas NHI suspension"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "」，停保期間不扣繳保費。回台後記得辦理「"
msgstr ""
"\". Premiums will not be charged during the suspension period. Remember "
"to apply for \""

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "復保"
msgstr "reinstatement"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "」以恢復保障。停保不影響居留證效期，但停保期間在台就醫無健保保障。"
msgstr ""
"\" upon return to restore your coverage. Suspension does not affect your "
"residence permit validity, but you will have no NHI coverage for medical "
"care in Taiwan during the suspension period."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "學校 OIA 會幫我辦居留證嗎？"
msgstr "Will the school OIA help me apply for the residence permit?"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid ""
"大多數學校會在開學初舉辦團體辦理場次，OIA 統一帶隊至移民署。建議迎新報到後立即前往 OIA "
"確認是否有統一辦理安排，以便提早準備所需文件，節省自行前往的時間。"
msgstr ""
"Most schools hold a group application session at the start of the "
"semester, with the OIA leading students to the NIA together. After "
"orientation, visit the OIA immediately to check if a group session is "
"arranged so you can prepare the required documents in advance."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "內政部移民署"
msgstr "Ministry of the Interior — National Immigration Agency (NIA)"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "辦事處查詢、線上預約、進度查詢、申請書下載。"
msgstr ""
"Office locator, online appointment, application status check, and form "
"downloads."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "居留說明、在學證明書申請、健康檢查指定醫院清單。"
msgstr ""
"Residence guidance, certificate of enrollment application, and list of "
"designated hospitals for health examinations."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "取得居留證後可辦理加保，享有完整醫療保障。"
msgstr ""
"After receiving your residence permit, you can enroll in NHI for "
"comprehensive medical coverage."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "外來人士在台生活諮詢"
msgstr "Foreign Resident Life Consultation Service"

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "多語言免費諮詢，涵蓋居留、生活、就業等問題。"
msgstr ""
"Free multilingual consultation covering residence, daily life, "
"employment, and other topics."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid ""
"「僑生」是指具有中華民國國籍或華裔血統、長期居住海外並在當地接受教育者，依教育部規定認定，可享僑生獎學金及僑先部等特別管道。「外籍生」則是持非中華民國國籍護照入學者，通常透過各校獨立招生管道申請，可申請教育部臺灣獎學金。兩者身份認定不同，適用的招生管道與優惠也不同。"
msgstr ""
"\"Overseas compatriot students\" (僑生) refers to those with ROC "
"citizenship or Chinese ancestry who have lived abroad long-term and "
"received education there, as recognized by the Ministry of Education. "
"They may access special channels such as overseas compatriot "
"scholarships and preparatory programs. \"International students\" (外籍生) "
"refers to those entering with a non-ROC passport, typically applying "
"through each university's independent international admissions process "
"and eligible for the Ministry of Education Taiwan Scholarship. The two "
"statuses are recognized differently, with different admissions channels "
"and benefits."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid ""
"不可以。海聯會管道僅適用於具僑生身份的申請者。外籍生（持外國國籍但不符僑生認定）須直接向各大學的國際招生辦公室申請，各校招生時程與文件要求請見各校官網。"
msgstr ""
"No. The OCAC channel is only available to applicants with overseas "
"compatriot student status. International students (those holding a "
"foreign passport but not recognized as overseas compatriot students) "
"must apply directly to each university's international admissions "
"office. Please visit the respective university websites for application "
"timelines and document requirements."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid "持外國國籍，完成相應學制的前置學歷（高中或大學畢業）。通常需提供中文（TOCFL）或英文（IELTS / TOEFL）能力證明，依各校系規定。"
msgstr ""
"Hold a foreign nationality and have completed the prerequisite education "
"for the target program (high school or university graduation). A Chinese "
"(TOCFL) or English (IELTS / TOEFL) proficiency certificate is usually "
"required, depending on each department's requirements."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid ""
"各系所對中文能力要求不同。部分系所設有最低中文檢定門檻（如 TOCFL B1 "
"以上），部分則接受入學後修讀中文語言課程作為補強。建議查閱目標系所的最新招生簡章確認，或聯繫學校國際事務處詢問。若中文尚未達標，也可先考慮申請全英語授課的系所或語言先修課程。"
msgstr ""
"Chinese proficiency requirements vary by department. Some departments "
"set a minimum Chinese proficiency threshold (e.g., TOCFL B1 or above), "
"while others accept enrollment in Chinese language courses after "
"admission as a supplement. We recommend checking the latest admission "
"guidelines for your target department or contacting the school's Office "
"of International Affairs. If your Chinese is not yet up to standard, you "
"may also consider applying to English-taught programs or language "
"preparatory courses."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid ""
"海聯會管道可填寫多個志願（學校 + "
"系所），系統依志願序分發，通常一個申請可含多個志願。外籍生透過各校獨立申請時，只要在截止期限前分別向各校提交申請即可，但需留意各校的申請費及文件要求可能不同。"
msgstr ""
"The OCAC channel allows you to fill in multiple preferences (school + "
"department), and the system assigns placements based on preference order "
"— one application typically covers multiple choices. For international "
"students applying to individual schools, simply submit separate "
"applications to each school before their respective deadlines, but note "
"that application fees and document requirements may differ between "
"schools."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid ""
"教育部臺灣獎學金需在入學申請時或入學後另行提出申請，通常透過台灣駐外機構或直接向學校申請，名額有限，競爭較激烈。僑生獎學金部分由海聯會或學校自動審核，部分需額外填寫申請表。學校自設的入學獎助學金通常在錄取通知中會一併說明。"
msgstr ""
"The Ministry of Education Taiwan Scholarship must be applied for "
"separately, either at the time of admission or after enrollment, "
"typically through Taiwan overseas representative offices or directly "
"through the school. Slots are limited and competition is strong. "
"Overseas compatriot scholarships are partly reviewed automatically by "
"OCAC or the school, and partly require a separate application form. "
"School-specific admission scholarships are usually explained in the "
"admission offer letter."

#: flows/templates/flows/guide_arc_exchange.html
msgid ""
"可以，但需注意轉學申請通常有年級限制（多限大二、大三），且需提供原校成績單及放棄學籍證明。各校轉學招生時程不一，通常在每學年結束前後辦理，詳情請查閱目標校系的轉學考簡章。研究所學生轉所需依各所規定辦理。"
msgstr ""
"Yes, but note that transfer applications usually have grade restrictions "
"(typically limited to 2nd or 3rd year), and require transcripts from "
"your current school and proof of withdrawal. Transfer admission "
"timelines vary by school and are typically held around the end of each "
"academic year. For details, consult the transfer examination guidelines "
"of your target school and department. Graduate students transferring "
"between programs must follow individual department regulations."



msgid "外籍生辦理居留證（ARC）"
msgstr "Foreign Student ARC Application (Alien Resident Certificate)"

msgid "外籍生專屬"
msgstr "For International Students"

msgid "持外國護照以正式學籍入台就讀的外籍生，須在抵台後"
msgstr ""
"Foreign students holding a foreign passport and enrolled in a formal "
"degree program must, within"

msgid "向內政部移民署辦理外僑居留證（ARC），方能在台合法居留及完成就學程序。"
msgstr ""
"days of arrival, apply for an Alien Resident Certificate (ARC) at the "
"National Immigration Agency to legally reside in Taiwan and complete "
"enrollment procedures."

msgid "抵台後 15 天內辦理"
msgstr "Apply within 15 days of arrival"

msgid "規費 NT$1,000 起"
msgstr "Fees from NT$1,000"

msgid "核發約 10 個工作天"
msgstr "Processing approx. 10 business days"

msgid "移民署各地服務站"
msgstr "NIA service stations nationwide"

msgid "首次申請規費"
msgstr "Initial Application Fees"

msgid "NT$1,000 起"
msgstr "From NT$1,000"

msgid "1年$1,000／2年$2,000／3年$3,000"
msgstr "1 yr $1,000 / 2 yrs $2,000 / 3 yrs $3,000"

msgid "觀光簽或免簽入台另加 NT$2,200"
msgstr "Add NT$2,200 if entering on tourist visa or visa-free"

msgid "效期"
msgstr "Validity"

msgid "1–3 年"
msgstr "1–3 Years"

msgid "依申請年數核發"
msgstr "Issued based on years applied"

msgid "不含退補件及面談"
msgstr "Excluding returns, supplemental documents, and interviews"

msgid "首次申請居留"
msgstr "Initial Residency Application"

msgid "剛入台的外籍生"
msgstr "Newly arrived international students"

msgid "居留延期"
msgstr "Residency Extension"

msgid "ARC 到期前續辦"
msgstr "Renew before ARC expires"

msgid "變更居留事由"
msgstr "Change of Residency Reason"

msgid "更換居留原因"
msgstr "Change reason for residence"

msgid "補換發"
msgstr "Replacement / Reissuance"

msgid "遺失或毀損補發"
msgstr "Reissue for lost or damaged card"

msgid "應備文件"
msgstr "Required Documents"

msgid "遺失 / 毀損"
msgstr "Lost / Damaged"

msgid "外國人居（停）留案件申請書"
msgstr "Application Form for Alien Resident/Visitor Permit"

msgid "可至移民署官網下載或現場索取，請事先填妥。"
msgstr ""
"Available for download on the NIA website or on-site. Please fill out in "
"advance."

msgid "近期彩色照片 2 張"
msgstr "2 recent color photos"

msgid "2 年內拍攝，2 吋白底（寬 3.5 cm × 高 4.5 cm）。"
msgstr "Taken within 2 years, 2-inch white background (W 3.5 cm × H 4.5 cm)."

msgid "有效護照及居留簽證"
msgstr "Valid passport and resident visa"

msgid "正本（審核後當場歸還）。護照效期須超過居留期限 6 個月以上。"
msgstr ""
"Original (returned after review). Passport must be valid at least 6 "
"months beyond the residency period."

msgid "居留事由證明文件 — 在學證明書 / 清冊及通知書"
msgstr ""
"Proof of Residency Reason — Enrollment Certificate / Registration List & "
"Notification"

msgid "由就讀學校國際事務處（OIA）出具，含入學日期及就讀系所，正本及影本各 1 份。"
msgstr ""
"Issued by the school's Office of International Affairs (OIA), including "
"enrollment date and department. 1 original and 1 copy required."

msgid "於台灣認可醫院完成，3 個月內有效。含胸部 X 光及肺結核篩檢。"
msgstr ""
"Completed at a hospital approved by Taiwan. Valid within 3 months. "
"Includes chest X-ray and tuberculosis screening."

msgid "本國警察刑事紀錄證明"
msgstr "Criminal Record Certificate from Home Country"

msgid "由母國警察或司法機關出具，1 年內有效。外文文件須經我國駐外館處驗證或在台公證。"
msgstr ""
"Issued by police or judicial authority of home country. Valid within 1 "
"year. Foreign-language documents must be verified by Taiwan's overseas "
"representative office or notarized in Taiwan."

msgid "住居所證明文件"
msgstr "Proof of Residence"

msgid "宿舍住宿證明或租屋合約書。"
msgstr "Dormitory accommodation certificate or rental agreement."

msgid "財力證明"
msgstr "Financial Proof"

msgid "銀行存款證明或獎學金核定文件，部分辦事處要求提供。"
msgstr ""
"Bank deposit certificate or scholarship award letter; required by some "
"offices."

msgid "規費"
msgstr "Fee"

msgid "1年 NT$1,000 / 2年 NT$2,000 / 3年 NT$3,000"
msgstr "1 yr NT$1,000 / 2 yrs NT$2,000 / 3 yrs NT$3,000"

msgid "以觀光簽或免簽入台者，另加 NT$2,200。"
msgstr "For those entering on a tourist visa or visa-free, add NT$2,200."

msgid "請事先填妥，移民署官網可下載。"
msgstr "Please fill out in advance; available for download on the NIA website."

msgid "2 年內拍攝，2 吋白底。"
msgstr "Taken within 2 years, 2-inch white background."

msgid "有效護照"
msgstr "Valid passport"

msgid "正本（審核後歸還）。"
msgstr "Original (returned after review)."

msgid "居留證正本及影本"
msgstr "ARC original and copy"

msgid "現有的 ARC 卡，正本及影本各 1 份。"
msgstr "Current ARC card, 1 original and 1 copy."

msgid "在學證明書（最新）"
msgstr "Enrollment Certificate (latest)"

msgid "由學校 OIA 出具，證明居留事由（就學）仍持續存在。"
msgstr ""
"Issued by school OIA, certifying that the residency reason (study) still "
"exists."

msgid "地址未變更者免附。"
msgstr "Not required if address has not changed."

msgid "地址變更才需要"
msgstr "Required only if address changed"

msgid "延期 NT$500。"
msgstr "Extension: NT$500."

msgid "請於 ARC 到期前 30 天內辦理。"
msgstr "Apply within 30 days before ARC expiration."

msgid "請事先填妥。"
msgstr "Please fill out in advance."

msgid "有效護照及現有居留證"
msgstr "Valid passport and current ARC"

msgid "護照及居留證正本及影本各 1 份。"
msgstr "1 original and 1 copy of passport and ARC."

msgid "新居留事由證明文件"
msgstr "Proof of New Residency Reason"

msgid "例如：從就學改為工作，需提供工作許可文件及聘僱合約。"
msgstr ""
"E.g., changing from study to work requires a work permit and employment "
"contract."

msgid "變更事由 NT$500。"
msgstr "Change of reason: NT$500."

msgid "正本及影本各 1 份。"
msgstr "1 original and 1 copy."

msgid "遺失：警察機關報案遺失報告書或具結書"
msgstr "Lost: Police report or sworn declaration of loss"

msgid "ARC 遺失時，請先至警察局報案，取得報案文件。"
msgstr ""
"If ARC is lost, first report to a police station and obtain a police "
"report."

msgid "遺失時必要"
msgstr "Required when lost"

msgid "毀損：被損壞之居留證正本"
msgstr "Damaged: Original damaged ARC card"

msgid "ARC 卡片毀損時，需攜帶損壞的原卡辦理換發。"
msgstr ""
"If the ARC card is damaged, bring the damaged original to apply for "
"reissuance."

msgid "毀損時必要"
msgstr "Required when damaged"

msgid "補換發 NT$500。"
msgstr "Replacement/Reissuance: NT$500."

msgid "申請須知 / 注意事項"
msgstr "Application Notes / Important Notices"

msgid "以下為內政部移民署官方申請須知（節錄自官方網站）"
msgstr ""
"The following are official application instructions from the National "
"Immigration Agency (excerpted from the official website)"

msgid ""
"在大陸、海外地區或港澳製作之文書，應經海基會、駐外館處或臺北經濟文化辦事處（香港、澳門）驗證。依規定繳附之文件為外文者，應經駐外館處驗證，並檢附經駐外館驗證或國內公證人認證之中譯本；預防接種證明為外文者，應至該管衛生所轉譯登錄。但依外國人才專法第二十四條準用同法第九條規定申請就業金卡者，免附。"
msgstr ""
"Documents produced in Mainland China, overseas, or Hong Kong/Macau must "
"be verified by the Straits Exchange Foundation (SEF), overseas "
"representative offices, or Taipei Economic and Cultural Offices (Hong "
"Kong/Macau). Documents submitted in a foreign language must be verified "
"by an overseas representative office and accompanied by a Chinese "
"translation certified by an overseas representative office or notarized "
"by a domestic notary; vaccination certificates in a foreign language "
"must be translated and registered at the relevant health center. "
"However, applicants applying for an Employment Gold Card under Article "
"24 of the Act for the Recruitment and Employment of Foreign "
"Professionals (applying mutatis mutandis Article 9) are exempt."

msgid ""
"居留一定期間之計算方式：自定居申請日往前推算，在臺連續居留滿一年（一年內得出境三十日，出境次數不予限制）或連續居留滿二年且每年在臺居住二百七十日以上。"
msgstr ""
"Calculation of required residency period: counted backward from the date "
"of household registration application — continuous residence in Taiwan "
"for one full year (with permitted departures of up to 30 days per year, "
"with no limit on number of departures) or continuous residence for two "
"full years with at least 270 days per year in Taiwan."

msgid ""
"經許可居留，在臺灣地區居留一定期間，仍具備原居留條件者（親屬關係因結婚或收養發生者，應存續三年以上。但婚姻關係存續期間已生產子女者，不在此限），得申請在臺灣地區定居。"
msgstr ""
"Persons permitted to reside who have resided in Taiwan for the required "
"period and still meet the original residency conditions (where family "
"relationships arose through marriage or adoption, the relationship must "
"have existed for at least three years; however, this does not apply "
"where children have been born during the marriage) may apply for "
"household registration in Taiwan."

msgid ""
"經中央目的事業主管機關核准來臺就學者畢業後（HF168），依第十六條第一項第八款規定經許可居留連續滿五年，每年在臺灣地區居住一百八十三日以上，且最近一年於臺灣地區平均每月收入達中央勞動主管機關公告基本工資二倍以上者，得申請在臺灣地區定居。"
msgstr ""
"Foreign students approved by the central competent authority to study in "
"Taiwan who have graduated (HF168), and who have been permitted to reside "
"continuously for five years under Article 16, Paragraph 1, Subparagraph "
"8 with at least 183 days per year in Taiwan, and whose average monthly "
"income in Taiwan during the most recent year is at least twice the "
"minimum wage announced by the central labor authority, may apply for "
"household registration in Taiwan."

msgid ""
"臺灣地區居留證有效期間屆滿前三十日內，原申請居留原因仍繼續存在者，得申請延期，每次不得逾二年；學生申請畢業延期居留者，自畢業當日起算六個月，延期居留期間屆滿前，得再申請延期一次，總延期居留期間最長為一年。（應備文件：1.申請書、2.臺灣地區居留證、3.其他相關證明文件）"
msgstr ""
"Within 30 days before the expiration of the Taiwan Area Resident "
"Certificate, applicants whose original residency reason still exists may "
"apply for an extension, not exceeding two years per application. "
"Students applying for a post-graduation extension may apply within six "
"months from graduation date, and may apply for one additional extension "
"before the extension period expires, with a total maximum extension of "
"one year. (Required documents: 1. Application form, 2. Taiwan Area "
"Resident Certificate, 3. Other relevant supporting documents)"

msgid ""
"依外國人才專法第二十四條規定經許可居留，原申請居留原因仍繼續存在者，得申請延期居留：1.準用同法第八條規定者：每次最長為五年。2.準用同法第五條至第七條、第九條及第十條規定者：每次最長為三年。"
msgstr ""
"Persons permitted to reside under Article 24 of the Act for the "
"Recruitment and Employment of Foreign Professionals, whose original "
"residency reason still exists, may apply for an extension: 1. Those "
"applying mutatis mutandis under Article 8: maximum five years per "
"extension. 2. Those applying mutatis mutandis under Articles 5 to 7, 9, "
"and 10: maximum three years per extension."

msgid "曾逾停留期限超過三十日未滿一年者，不予許可期間自其出境之日起算一年；逾期停留一年以上未滿二年者，起算二年；逾期停留二年以上者，起算三年。"
msgstr ""
"Those who have overstayed by more than 30 days but less than one year: "
"the period of denial starts one year from the date of departure; those "
"who overstayed one year or more but less than two years: two years; "
"those who overstayed two years or more: three years."

msgid "申請案件資料不符或欠缺者，應於書面通知送達之翌日起三個月內補正；未於規定期間補正或補正仍不合規定者，駁回其申請。"
msgstr ""
"If application materials are deficient or incomplete, the applicant must "
"correct them within three months from the day following delivery of "
"written notification. Failure to correct within the prescribed period or "
"failure to meet requirements after correction will result in the "
"application being rejected."

msgid "香港澳門居民以依親事由及其隨同申請之未成年子女申請在臺灣地區居留，其親屬關係因收養發生者，應存續二年以上。"
msgstr ""
"Hong Kong and Macau residents applying for residence in Taiwan on the "
"basis of family reunion, and their minor children applying together, "
"where the family relationship arose through adoption, the relationship "
"must have existed for at least two years."

msgid ""
"港澳居民逾期居留未滿三十日，原申請居留原因仍繼續存在者，經依相關規定處罰、繳清罰鍰後，得向本署重新申請居留；港澳居民未於居留期間屆滿前經許可延期居留，且逾期居留三十日以上者，應繳清罰款，並申請出境證出境。"
msgstr ""
"Hong Kong and Macau residents who have overstayed by less than 30 days "
"and whose original residency reason still exists may reapply for "
"residency with the Agency after being penalized and paying all fines in "
"accordance with relevant regulations; those who have not obtained a "
"permitted extension before their residency expires and have overstayed "
"for 30 days or more must pay all fines and apply for a departure permit "
"to exit."

msgid "港澳居民依外國人才專法第二十四條規定準用同法第九條規定以網路申請平臺申請就業金卡者，相關規定請參考「外國特定專業人才申請就業金卡送件須知」。"
msgstr ""
"Hong Kong and Macau residents applying for an Employment Gold Card "
"through the online application platform under Article 24 of the Act for "
"the Recruitment and Employment of Foreign Professionals (applying "
"mutatis mutandis Article 9) should refer to the \"Submission "
"Instructions for Foreign Special Professionals Applying for Employment "
"Gold Card.\""

msgid "申請須知 & 相關文件下載"
msgstr "Application Notes & Related Document Downloads"

msgid "0902－外國人申請居留及延期居留或變更居留原因送件須知（20260116）"
msgstr ""
"0902 — Submission Instructions for Foreign Nationals Applying for "
"Residency, Extension of Stay, or Change of Residency Reason (20260116)"

msgid "外國人居（停）留案件申請表（20220801 版）"
msgstr "Application Form for Alien Resident/Visitor Permit (Version 20220801)"

msgid "在職證明書"
msgstr "Certificate of Employment"

msgid "內政部移民署 — 居留申請說明"
msgstr "National Immigration Agency — Residency Application Guide"

msgid "應備文件官方說明、辦事處查詢、線上預約、申請書下載。"
msgstr ""
"Official document requirements, office lookup, online appointment, and "
"application form download."

msgid "在學證明申請、指定合作醫院確認、ARC 辦理協助。"
msgstr ""
"Enrollment certificate application, designated partner hospital "
"confirmation, and ARC application assistance."

msgid "領取 ARC 後，持 ARC 和學校加保公文辦理加保程序。"
msgstr ""
"After receiving your ARC, bring it along with the school's NHI "
"enrollment document to complete the enrollment process."

msgid "提供多語言諮詢服務，解答居留、就業、生活等問題。"
msgstr ""
"Provides multilingual consultation services addressing residency, "
"employment, and daily life inquiries."


msgid "僑生專屬服務"
msgstr "Overseas Chinese Student Service"

msgid "持外國護照入台就讀的僑生，必須在抵台後"
msgstr ""
"Overseas Chinese students entering Taiwan on a foreign passport must, "
"within"

msgid "天內"
msgstr "days of arrival,"

msgid "向內政部移民署線上辦理外僑居留證（ARC），方能在台合法居留及就讀。"
msgstr ""
"apply online to the National Immigration Agency (NIA) for an Alien "
"Resident Certificate (ARC) to legally reside in Taiwan and complete "
"enrollment."

msgid "辦理期限：入境次日起 30 天內"
msgstr "Deadline: Within 30 days of entry"

msgid "規費：NT$500（僑生1年）"
msgstr "Fee: NT$500 (1-year for Overseas Chinese Students)"

msgid "地點：移民署各地服務站"
msgstr "Location: NIA service stations nationwide"

msgid "請注意："
msgstr "Please Note:"

msgid "持居留簽證入境次日起"
msgstr "Starting the day after entering on a resident visa,"

msgid "，需自行至移民署線上系統辦理外僑居留證，逾期將被處罰鍰，嚴重者需出境重新申請簽證。ARC 是後續辦理加保、開戶等必要身份證明，請儘快辦理。"
msgstr ""
"you must apply for the ARC through the NIA online system on your own. "
"Late applications will result in fines; in serious cases you may be "
"required to leave and reapply for a visa. The ARC is required for health "
"insurance enrollment, bank account opening, and other essential "
"procedures. Please apply as soon as possible."

msgid "1 年"
msgstr "1 Year"

msgid "每年需延期"
msgstr "Annual renewal required"

msgid "以下為一般應備文件，各移民署辦事處可能有細微差異。建議事前致電當地辦事處或至移民署官網確認最新版清單。"
msgstr ""
"The following are general required documents. Specific requirements may "
"vary slightly between NIA offices. It is recommended to call your local "
"office or check the NIA official website for the most up-to-date list."

msgid "外國護照"
msgstr "Foreign Passport"

msgid "正本及影本各 1 份，效期須超過居留期間 6 個月以上。"
msgstr ""
"Original and one copy each; passport must be valid for at least 6 months "
"beyond the residence period."

msgid "入台學生簽證（居留簽）"
msgstr "Taiwan Student Visa (Resident Visa)"

msgid "持有入境台灣的學生居留簽證影本。"
msgstr "A copy of the student resident visa used to enter Taiwan."

msgid "僑生應核發的身份確認函"
msgstr "Identity Confirmation Letter for Overseas Chinese Students"

msgid "僑生還需提供僑委會或僑生應核發的身份確認文件正本及影本。"
msgstr ""
"Overseas Chinese students must also provide the original and a copy of "
"the identity confirmation document issued by the OCAC or the relevant "
"authority."

msgid "在學證明書 / 清冊及通知書"
msgstr "Enrollment Certificate / Registration List & Notice"

msgid "由就讀學校出具的在學證明或入學許可函，需含入學日期及就讀系所。"
msgstr ""
"Issued by your school, stating enrollment status or admission letter, "
"including enrollment date and department."

msgid "於台灣認可醫院完成之健康檢查報告，需含胸部 X 光及肺結核篩檢結果。"
msgstr ""
"Health examination report conducted at a Taiwan-approved hospital, "
"including chest X-ray and tuberculosis screening."

msgid "近 6 個月內拍攝之 2 吋白底彩色照片（規格：寬 3.5 cm × 高 4.5 cm）。"
msgstr ""
"Color photos taken within the last 6 months, 2-inch white background "
"(3.5 cm × 4.5 cm)."

msgid "外僑居留申請書"
msgstr "Alien Resident Application Form"

msgid "可於移民署官網下載或現場索取，請事先填妥基本資料。"
msgstr ""
"Available for download on the NIA website or at the counter. Please fill "
"out in advance."

msgid "宿舍住宿證或租屋合約書，部分辦事處或要求。"
msgstr ""
"Dormitory residence certificate or rental contract; may be required by "
"some offices."

msgid "全程線上辦理："
msgstr "Fully Online:"

msgid "居留證申請及延期皆以線上申辦為主。請至移民署「外國與外僑學生線上申辦系統」自行申請，"
msgstr ""
"ARC applications and renewals are processed online. Please apply through "
"the NIA \"Online Application System for Foreign and Overseas Chinese "
"Students\" on your own,"

msgid "請勿選擇「就讀學校代辦」"
msgstr "do NOT select \"School-Assisted Application\""

msgid "（中央大學無此服務）。"
msgstr "(NCU does not provide this service)."

msgid "外國與外僑學生線上申辦系統 ↗"
msgstr "Online Application System for Foreign & Overseas Chinese Students ↗"

msgid "抵台後完成體檢並整理文件"
msgstr "Complete health check and prepare documents after arrival"

msgid ""
"確認護照、入學通知函、在學證明等文件齊全。若需完成健康檢查，請至學校認可醫院辦理（國際事務處可提供名單）。非港澳生及持有效居留證的港澳生可參加校內體檢（約 "
"NT$780）。"
msgstr ""
"Ensure all documents are ready: passport, admission letter, and "
"enrollment certificate. For the health examination, go to a hospital "
"recognized by the school (the OIA can provide a list). Non-HK/Macau "
"students and HK/Macau students with a valid ARC may take the on-campus "
"health exam (approx. NT$780)."

msgid "至移民署線上系統註冊並上傳文件"
msgstr "Register on the NIA online system and upload documents"

msgid ""
"前往移民署「外國與外僑學生線上申辦系統」完成帳號註冊，掃描並上傳所需文件：近三個月 2 "
"吋彩色照片、護照、入學通知函及在學證明書。系統操作請參閱官方操作手冊。"
msgstr ""
"Go to the NIA \"Online Application System for Foreign and Overseas "
"Chinese Students\" to register an account, then scan and upload required "
"documents: a 2-inch color photo taken within the last 3 months, "
"passport, admission letter, and enrollment certificate. Refer to the "
"official user manual for system instructions."

msgid "抵台後 30 天內"
msgstr "Within 30 days of arrival"

msgid "全程線上"
msgstr "Fully Online"

msgid "繳納申請規費"
msgstr "Pay the application fee"

msgid "線上申請時繳交規費 NT$500（1 年居留證）。繳費後保存收據以備查。"
msgstr ""
"Pay the NT$500 fee (1-year ARC) when submitting online. Keep the receipt "
"for reference."

msgid "NT$500 / 年"
msgstr "NT$500 / Year"

msgid "等待審核與製證"
msgstr "Wait for review and card production"

msgid "申請提交後通常需"
msgstr "After submission, it usually takes"

msgid "製卡完成（不含退補件）。可至移民署線上查詢申請進度。等待期間請保留入境章及申請收據作為合法居留的暫時證明。"
msgstr ""
"to produce the card (excluding returned/supplementary documents). You "
"can check the application progress online at the NIA. During the waiting "
"period, keep your entry stamp and application receipt as temporary proof "
"of legal residence."

msgid "上傳居留證至 NCU Portal"
msgstr "Upload ARC to NCU Portal"

msgid "取得居留證後，需於入學當年"
msgstr ""
"After obtaining the ARC, you must upload it to the NCU Portal by "
"September 30 of your enrollment year."

msgid "月"
msgstr "/"

msgid "日前"
msgstr ""

msgid "上傳至 NCU Portal（入口網站）。未準時上傳將影響校內工讀金撥款、獎學金核發及相關權益。"
msgstr ""
"Failure to upload on time will affect work-study payments, scholarship "
"disbursements, and other entitlements."

msgid "9/30 前"
msgstr "By 9/30"

msgid "完成！辦理後續程序"
msgstr "Done! Complete follow-up procedures"

msgid "居留證到手後即可辦理加入健保、開設銀行帳戶、申辦手機門號等後續程序。"
msgstr ""
"Once you receive the ARC, you can proceed with enrolling in NHI, opening "
"a bank account, registering a mobile phone number, and other follow-up "
"procedures."

msgid "居留證到期前"
msgstr "Before your ARC expires,"

msgid "個月內"
msgstr "months,"

msgid "可至移民署網站線上申請延期，規費 NT$500 / 年，核辦約 10 天。建議每學年結束前提早辦理，避免居留資格失效。"
msgstr ""
"you can apply online at the NIA website to renew, with a fee of "
"NT$500/year and processing time of about 10 days. It is recommended to "
"apply early before the end of each academic year to avoid loss of "
"residence status."

msgid "請勿選擇「就讀學校代辦」："
msgstr "Do NOT Select \"School-Assisted Application\":"

msgid "中央大學（NCU）不提供學校代辦服務，請學生自行登入線上申辦系統辦理，勿在系統中選擇此選項。"
msgstr ""
"NCU does not provide school-assisted application services. Students must "
"log in to the online system and apply on their own. Do not select this "
"option in the system."

msgid "居留證遺失時請立即至警局報案，持報案證明至移民署申請補發（規費 NT$500）。補發時建議隨身攜帶護照及報案證明。"
msgstr ""
"If your ARC is lost, immediately report it to the police and bring the "
"police report to the NIA to apply for a replacement (fee: NT$500). It is "
"recommended to carry your passport and police report when applying."

msgid "我是台灣的僑生（台灣護照）的僑生也需要辦居留證嗎？"
msgstr ""
"Do overseas Chinese students with Taiwan citizenship (Taiwan passport) "
"also need to apply for an ARC?"

msgid "不需要。持中華民國籍由僑居地（台灣護照）入台的僑生，具有完整公民身份，無需辦理居留證。本頁服務適用於持外國護照入台就讀的僑生（海外永久居民等）。"
msgstr ""
"No. Overseas Chinese students who enter Taiwan as ROC nationals (Taiwan "
"passport holders) have full citizenship status and do not need an ARC. "
"This page applies to overseas Chinese students entering Taiwan on a "
"foreign passport (e.g., overseas permanent residents)."

msgid "健康檢查可以在抵台後才做嗎？"
msgstr "Can the health examination be done after arriving in Taiwan?"

msgid ""
"可以。可於抵台後參加校內體檢（約 NT$780），或至學校指定醫院完成。注意檢查報告出爐需數天，請盡早安排以避免超過 30 "
"天辦理期限。建議抵台後隔天即至國際事務處詢問體檢安排。"
msgstr ""
"Yes. You can take the on-campus health exam after arrival (approx. "
"NT$780) or go to a designated hospital. Note that results take several "
"days, so arrange early to avoid exceeding the 30-day deadline. It is "
"recommended to visit the OIA the day after arrival to inquire about "
"health exam arrangements."

msgid "居留證辦理期間可以在台灣合法居留嗎？"
msgstr ""
"Can I legally reside in Taiwan while the ARC application is being "
"processed?"

msgid "可以。申請提交後至居留證核發前，持入境章及申請收據即可作為合法居留證明。建議隨身攜帶此兩份文件，以備需要時出示。"
msgstr ""
"Yes. From the time of submission until the ARC is issued, your entry "
"stamp and application receipt serve as proof of legal residence. It is "
"recommended to carry both documents at all times in case they are "
"needed."

msgid "可以在不同縣市的移民署辦事處辦理嗎？"
msgstr "Can I apply at an NIA office in a different city or county?"

msgid "可以。全台各縣市均設有移民署服務站，選擇距離學校最近的辦事處即可。但建議選擇學校所在縣市的辦事處，方便日後延期和處理相關事務。"
msgstr ""
"Yes. NIA service stations are located in every city and county in "
"Taiwan; choose the one closest to your school. However, it is "
"recommended to use the office in the city/county where your school is "
"located, for convenience with future renewals."

msgid "畢業後若要繼續留台，居留資格如何處理？"
msgstr ""
"How should I handle my residence status if I want to remain in Taiwan "
"after graduation?"

msgid ""
"在學期間以「就讀」為居留事由。畢業後如需繼續留台（例如找工作），需在畢業後 30 "
"天內申請變更居留事由為「工作」或「其他」，或在找到合法工作並取得工作許可後辦理變更為「工作」居留事由。建議畢業前盡早規劃，避免居留證失效。"
msgstr ""
"During your studies, the basis for residence is \"student enrollment.\" "
"If you wish to remain in Taiwan after graduation (e.g., to find work), "
"you must apply to change your residence basis to \"work\" or \"other\" "
"within 30 days of graduation, or change it to \"work\" after obtaining a "
"legal job and work permit. Plan ahead before graduation to avoid the ARC "
"expiring."

