msgid "ATM 繳費"
msgstr "ATM Payment"

msgid "先完成線上申請 → 學校審核 → 系統產生 16 碼繳費帳號 → 使用 ATM「繳費」功能繳納。"
msgstr ""
"Complete online application → school review → system generates a "
"16-digit payment account → pay using ATM \"Bill Payment\" function."

msgid "線上申請流程"
msgstr "Online Application Process"

msgid "全程於勞動部「外國人在台工作服務網」線上辦理，選擇「"
msgstr ""
"The entire process is handled online at the MOL \"Foreign Workers in "
"Taiwan Service Network\". Select \""

msgid "僑外生工讀申請"
msgstr "Overseas Chinese / Int'l Student Work-Study Application"

msgid "」。"
msgstr "\"."

msgid "準備應備文件並繳費"
msgstr "Prepare required documents and pay the fee"

msgid "將學生證（正反面含註冊章）、護照、居留證（ARC 正反面）掃描為 PDF。並先至郵局劃撥繳納審查費 NT$100（或選擇 ATM 後繳）。"
msgstr ""
"Scan your student ID (front and back with registration stamp), passport, "
"and ARC (front and back) as PDF files. Pay the NT$100 review fee via "
"post office transfer in advance (or choose ATM payment later)."

msgid "至 ezwp 系統註冊 / 登入"
msgstr "Register / Log in to the ezwp system"

msgid "前往"
msgstr "Go to"

msgid "，選擇「僑外生工讀申請」，依指示註冊帳號或登入。"
msgstr ""
", select \"Overseas Chinese / Int'l Student Work-Study Application\", "
"then register an account or log in as directed."

msgid "填寫申請資料"
msgstr "Fill in the application details"

msgid "步驟 2 — 校園資訊："
msgstr "Step 2 — Campus Information:"

msgid "填寫學校地址與國際學生顧問室資訊"
msgstr "Enter the school address and International Student Office information"

msgid "步驟 3 — 申請事項："
msgstr "Step 3 — Application Details:"

msgid "選擇「個人申請」，許可期限最長"
msgstr "Select \"Personal Application\"; maximum permit duration is"

msgid "領取方式："
msgstr "Delivery Method:"

msgid "可選電子文件（需於 8 天內下載）或郵寄至學校"
msgstr ""
"Choose electronic document (must be downloaded within 8 days) or postal "
"delivery to school"

msgid "上傳文件並送出"
msgstr "Upload documents and submit"

msgid "上傳掃描好的 PDF 文件，確認資料無誤後送出申請。"
msgstr ""
"Upload the scanned PDF documents, confirm all details are correct, then "
"submit the application."

msgid "注意：系統暫存最多保留 7 天，逾期需重新填寫。"
msgstr ""
"Note: The system saves drafts for a maximum of 7 days; after that you "
"must start over."

msgid "等待審核"
msgstr "Wait for review"

msgid "送出後由學校及勞動部審核，期間可至系統查詢進度。"
msgstr ""
"After submission, the application is reviewed by the school and the MOL. "
"Check the progress in the system during this time."

msgid "取得許可前不得開始工作。"
msgstr "Do not start working before the permit is issued."

msgid "取得工作許可，開始工作"
msgstr "Obtain the work permit and start working"

msgid "許可核發後即可依核准內容開始工作。若選擇電子文件，請於 8 天內至系統下載許可證。"
msgstr ""
"Once the permit is issued, you may begin working as approved. If you "
"chose electronic delivery, download the permit from the system within 8 "
"days."

msgid "工時規定"
msgstr "Working Hours Rules"

msgid "期間"
msgstr "Period"

msgid "工時上限"
msgstr "Hour Limit"

msgid "上課期間（學期中）"
msgstr "During Classes (in-semester)"

msgid "每週最多 20 小時"
msgstr "Max 20 hrs/week"

msgid "週一至週日合計不得超過 20 小時，超時視同違規"
msgstr "Total Mon–Sun must not exceed 20 hours; exceeding this is a violation"

msgid "寒假・暑假"
msgstr "Winter / Summer Vacation"

msgid "無限制"
msgstr "No limit"

msgid "可全職工作，時數無上限"
msgstr "Full-time work allowed, no hour cap"

msgid "短期交換生 / 語研生"
msgstr "Short-term Exchange / Language Study Students"

msgid "不得工作"
msgstr "Not permitted"

msgid "不符合申請資格，任何工作均屬違規"
msgstr "Not eligible to apply; any work is a violation"

msgid "違規後果"
msgstr "Consequences of Violations"

msgid "罰鍰 NT$30,000～150,000"
msgstr "Fine: NT$30,000–150,000"

msgid "未持工作許可違法工作者，依就業服務法可處罰鍰新臺幣三萬元至十五萬元。"
msgstr ""
"Those who work without a valid work permit may be fined "
"NT$30,000–150,000 under the Employment Services Act."

msgid "限令出境"
msgstr "Deportation Order"

msgid "主管機關可依規定限令違規者出境，情節嚴重者可能影響日後再入境資格。"
msgstr ""
"The competent authority may order violators to leave the country; "
"serious cases may affect future re-entry eligibility."

msgid "雇主連帶受罰"
msgstr "Employer Also Penalized"

msgid "非法僱用外籍生的雇主同樣面臨罰鍰，請勿在未取得工作許可前接受工作邀約。"
msgstr ""
"Employers who illegally hire international students also face fines. Do "
"not accept job offers before obtaining a work permit."

msgid "換工作需重新申請："
msgstr "Changing Jobs Requires a New Application:"

msgid "工作許可針對特定雇主核發，換雇主或增加兼職均須重新申請新的工作許可，不可沿用舊許可。"
msgstr ""
"Work permits are issued for a specific employer. Changing employers or "
"adding a part-time job requires a new application; the old permit cannot "
"be reused."

msgid "許可期限最長 6 個月："
msgstr "Maximum Permit Duration is 6 Months:"

msgid "到期前需提前申請展延，過期繼續工作視同無許可違規。"
msgstr ""
"Apply for renewal before expiry; continuing to work after expiry counts "
"as working without a permit."

msgid "畢業生注意："
msgstr "Graduates Please Note:"

msgid "畢業生工作許可通常至"
msgstr "Graduates' work permits are typically valid until"

msgid "日"
msgstr ""

msgid "截止。如有暑期課程（需附證明）或已獲錄取繼續升學者，方可延長至"
msgstr ""
". If enrolled in a summer program (proof required) or admitted for "
"further study, the permit may be extended to"

msgid "。"
msgstr "."

msgid "系統暫存限制："
msgstr "System Draft Limit:"

msgid "ezwp 系統暫存資料最多保留"
msgstr "The ezwp system saves draft data for a maximum of"

msgid "天"
msgstr "days"

msgid "，逾期需重新填寫。選擇電子文件領取者，須於核發後"
msgstr ""
"; after that you must start over. If you chose electronic delivery, "
"download the permit within"

msgid "至系統下載許可證。"
msgstr "of issuance."

msgid "工作期間健保轉換："
msgstr "NHI Transfer During Employment:"

msgid "受僱工作後需在雇主處投保健保（第 1 類），請先至學校辦理轉出，避免重複投保。工作結束後需回學校重新加保。"
msgstr ""
"Once employed, you must enroll in NHI under your employer (Category 1). "
"First de-enroll from the school's NHI to avoid duplicate coverage. "
"Re-enroll with the school after employment ends."

msgid "相關連結"
msgstr "Related Links"

msgid "勞動部外國人在台工作服務網 ↗"
msgstr "MOL Foreign Workers in Taiwan Service Network ↗"

msgid "勞動部勞動力發展署 ↗"
msgstr "Workforce Development Agency, MOL ↗"

msgid "NCU 國際事務處 ↗"
msgstr "NCU Office of International Affairs ↗"
